{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2206"},"reason":"Tivoli's rank as the 'second-oldest' amusement park still operating is disputed: Vienna's Wurstelprater goes back to the opening of the Prater in 1766. The body now says Tivoli is 'usually called' the second-oldest and names the rival claim.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wurstelprater"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tivoli_Gardens"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",174],["+","what is usually called "],["=",2],["-","second-oldest."],["+","second-oldest"],["=",1],["+","(Vienna's Wurstelprater, whose rides go back to the 1766 opening of the Prater, is sometimes counted as older). "],["=",595]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",150],["-","zweitälteste"],["+","meist"],["=",1],["+","als zweitältester bezeichnete "],["=",4],["-","Kopenhagen."],["+","Kopenhagen"],["=",1],["+","(der Wiener Wurstelprater, dessen Attraktionen auf die Öffnung des Praters 1766 zurückgehen, wird mitunter als älter gezählt). "],["=",553]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",158],["-","второй"],["+","парк,"],["=",1],["+","который обычно называют вторым "],["=",2],["-","старшинству."],["+","старшинству"],["=",1],["+","(венский Вурстельпратер, чьи аттракционы восходят к открытию Пратера в 1766 году, иногда считают более старым). "],["=",533]]}],"hash":"872fbf134580","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"51cdc3ef7f7dfaf4e3ab8f83c4d319c157f108ecbce8943da31edf010e6d2e1b"},
